  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mitigation of tensions in Sudan by supporting inclusive political dialogue and local coexistence processes</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;overall objective&lt;/strong&gt; is to contribute to the mitigation of local and political tensions in Sudan, by supporting local dialogue processes in Darfur and East Sudan involving armed and civilian actors, providing an informal dialogue platform for the main political forces, and strengthening the participation of women leaders in peace and coexistence initiatives both at national and local level&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
